STM32CubeC5
###########

Origin:
   STMicroelectronics
   https://www.st.com/en/embedded-software/stm32cubec5.html

Status:
   version 2.1.0

Purpose:
   STMicroelectronics official MCU package for STM32C5 series.

Description:
   This package is an extract of official STM32CubeC5 package written by STMicroelectronics.
   It is composed of STM32Cube hardware abstraction layer (HAL) and low layer (LL) plus a set
   of CMSIS headers files, one for each SoC in the STM32C5 series.

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeC5

Commit:
   abeee83eb7181ce278c65681196ede45c930a7ec

Maintained-by:
   External

License:
